1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,040
Gata cu minciunile!

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,320
Adevărul, acum.

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,613
Ești ridicol moșule.

4
00:00:05,613 --> 00:00:08,440
Ăsta-i adevărul!

5
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:09,800
Nu-i poți face față?

6
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:11,880
Ah, scuze!

7
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:14,644
Nu poți accepta faptul că

8
00:00:14,644 --> 00:00:16,440
ți-ai abuzat adevăratul fiu.

9
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:19,000
Oops, hehehe.

10
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:22,280
Timmy.

11
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,149
În tot timpul ăsta,

12
00:00:25,149 --> 00:00:26,680
Timothy era fiul nostru.

13
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:29,520
De ce, Matthew?

14
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:30,920
De ce ai face asta?

15
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:32,240
De ce?

16
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:34,520
De ce nu?

17
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:39,680
Amândoi eram orfani.

18
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:41,425
De ce el a fost adoptat de o familie

19
00:00:41,425 --> 00:00:43,415
bogată și iubitoare, care s-a dovedit

20
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:45,250
a fi adevărata lui familie,

21
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:47,800
iar eu am fost tot cel nedorit?

22
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:52,200
La dracu cu asta!

23
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:53,840
Dar acum?

24
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:58,375
Acum el e mort, eu câștig.

25
00:00:58,400 --> 00:00:59,882
Eu câștig.

26
00:00:59,882 --> 00:01:00,920
Ha, ha!

